{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22213","headline":"栽杉 · 白居易","name":"栽杉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劲叶森利劒，孤茎挺端标。\n才高四五尺，势若干青霄。\n移栽东窗前，爱尔寒不凋。\n病夫卧相对，日夕闲萧萧。\n昨爲山中树，今爲檐下条。\n虽然遇赏玩，无乃近尘嚣。\n犹胜涧谷底，埋没随衆樵。\n不见郁郁松，委质山上苗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}